hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2924","###\n Narrated to us by Bundar, narrated to us by Yahya bin Sa'id, narrated to us by Ja'far, who said: My father narrated to me, saying: \I went to Jabir bin Abdullah.\"" And also narrated to us by Al-Abbar bin Al-Ala' and Al-Za'farani"","" who said: Narrated to us by Sufyan"","" from Ja'far bin Muhammad"","" from his father"","" from Jabir"","" who said: \""The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) commanded that from"""""
